<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Comparisons of unified score on <span id="S2.T1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Unified-Bench</span>, the first benchmark specifically for evaluating the unification between understanding and generation models in the unified multimodal systems. <span id="S2.T1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> indicates the best result, and <span id="S2.T1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span> denotes the second best.</figcaption>
