<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Comparisons of text-to-image generation capability on GenEval <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib13" title="" class="ltx_ref">13</a>]</cite> benchmark. ‘<math id="S2.T2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math>’ refers to the methods using LLM rewriter. <span id="S2.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> indicates the best result, and <span id="S2.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span> denotes the second best.</figcaption>
